@patterns.observer

Purpose:
  One-to-many dependency notification.

Owns: references\patterns\observer.sdd
UseWhen:
  - state change affects multiple objects
  - need to notify without tight coupling
  - event handling

AvoidWhen:
  - simple direct calls suffice
  - single consumer

Why:
  Maintains consistency without hard dependencies.

Related:
  @ddd.domain-event
  @architecture.event-driven

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
